        <mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;«Claim» membership&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;statement: &quot;The cfde-inc-v2 gene-set collection used by PIGEAN includes NOD2 as a member of …&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;no has_score, no direction&lt;/b&gt; — decision 2026-11-06: ingest only the set name and its genes, not the per-pair betas&lt;br&gt;source_locator: gene_gene_set_stats.json#gene=NOD2;gene_set=…" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
